Split-BF16 router GEMM
  vllm/models/maxwell_v1_flash/nvidia/ops/split_bf16_gemm.py records
  https://github.com/Tencent/hpc-ops as an algorithm reference for splitting
  FP32 router weights into BF16 high and residual terms. The integration
  implements the router operation with Triton and FP32 accumulation.

